# OS-regenerated ephemera — Finder rewrites .DS_Store into any browsed directory,
# so a source-tree zero is non-terminal. The freeze/build excludes these
# structurally (see references/tool-liveness.md §6); this keeps them out of VCS too.
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.dev.vars*
.npmrc
.public-safety.local
.wrangler/
coverage/
dist/
node_modules/
src/generated-materials.ts
*.skill
